// simplex-learning: Real-time Continuous Learning for Simplex
//
// This library enables neural gates and specialists to learn and improve
// during execution. The boundary between code and model dissolves.
//
// Core modules:
//   - tensor:      Tensor operations with autograd (reverse-mode AD)
//                  DualTensor for forward-mode AD (meta-gradients)
//   - dual:        Dual numbers for forward-mode automatic differentiation
//   - optim:       Streaming optimizers
//   - memory:      Experience replay, forgetting prevention
//   - feedback:    Feedback collection and attribution
//   - calibration: Confidence calibration
//   - safety:      Safe learning constraints
//   - distributed: Hive-wide coordinated learning
//   - runtime:     Learning loop and checkpointing
//   - belief:      TASK-014: Grounded beliefs with epistemic metadata
//   - epistemic:   TASK-014: Epistemic annealing and self-correction
//   - quantum:     TASK-021: Quantum-classical bridge, epistemic beliefs, neural gates
//   - kan:         Kolmogorov-Arnold Networks with B-spline edge activations
//   - causal:      Causal inference: DAGs, do-calculus, d-separation, adjustment
//   - ssm:         State Space Models: S4 (structured) and Mamba (selective) layers
//   - info_geometry: Information geometry, natural gradients, K-FAC, KL divergence
//   - conformal:  Conformal prediction: calibration, prediction sets, coverage
//   - moe:        Mixture of Experts: sparse gating, load balancing, top-k routing
//   - interpretability: Mechanistic interpretability: activations, attribution, probing, ablation
//   - neural_ode:  Neural ODEs: continuous-depth networks, ODE solvers, CNF
//   - neurosymbolic: Neuro-symbolic hybrid reasoning: KB, Horn clauses, unification, chaining
//   - hopfield:    Modern Hopfield associative memory: exponential capacity, attention
//   - liquid:      Liquid Neural Networks: liquid neurons, NCPs, CfC cells
//   - hyperbolic:  Hyperbolic embeddings: Poincare ball, Mobius ops, RSGD
//   - sdm:         Sparse Distributed Memory (Kanerva) and Hyperdimensional Computing
//   - diffusion:   Diffusion language generation: discrete denoising, masking, sampling
//   - tensor_network: Tensor network compression: TT/MPS decomposition, SVD, Tucker
//   - equivariant: Geometric equivariant layers: rotations, GNN, spherical harmonics

pub mod tensor;
pub mod dual;
